==Description==
The '''Polluted Nametag''' is a nametag that was obtained from a [[Nuclear Monster Mini Plush]] code.

The '''Polluted Nametag''' has green text and a black outline surrounded by green smoke and electricity. It also releases small green squares that move around it. The electricity has a pixelated look, similar to the [[Lightning Nametag]]. Additionally, the same small green squares seen on this nametag are also present on enemies like the [[Toxic]].

